{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49073","headline":"巫山一段云 二 · 昭宗皇帝","name":"巫山一段云 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝶舞棃园雪，莺啼柳带烟。\n小池残日艳阳天，苎萝山又山。\n青鸟不来愁绝，忍看鸳鸯双结。\n春风一等少年心，闲情恨不禁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昭宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}